---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/apiDocs.css';
---
<Base title="API Reference">
  <h1>API Reference</h1>
  <p class="lede">This site was built API-first from day one, specifically so a future companion app (or anything else) could reuse the same backend the web pages themselves call. Every endpoint below is real and currently live &mdash; this page is generated by hand from the actual route source, not a spec written separately from the code.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Authentication</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.75rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;">Most GET endpoints are public. <span class="auth-badge">Admin</span> marks ones that need a session token.</p>
    <ol style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;">
      <li><code>POST /api/auth/login</code> with JSON body <code>&lbrace;"password": "..."&rbrace;</code> &mdash; returns <code>&lbrace;"token": "..."&rbrace;</code> on success, <code>401</code> on a wrong password, <code>429</code> after too many failed attempts (with a <code>Retry-After</code> header).</li>
      <li>Send the token on every admin request as <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code>.</li>
      <li><code>POST /api/auth/logout</code> (Admin) invalidates the token server-side.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">QSO Log</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Paginated, filterable QSO list. Query params: <code>limit</code> (max 200), <code>offset</code>, <code>from</code>/<code>to</code> (YYYY-MM-DD), <code>bands</code>/<code>modes</code>/<code>countries</code>/<code>states</code> (comma-separated).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/geo</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Lat/lon points for the QSO Map, same filter params as above.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/bands</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Distinct bands worked, with per-band counts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/modes</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Distinct modes worked, with per-mode counts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/countries</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Distinct DXCC countries worked, with counts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/states</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Distinct US states worked, with counts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/facets</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Faceted counts (how many results per band/mode/country/state given the other active filters) &mdash; powers the Log/Map filter panel's live chip counts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/on-this-day</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Every QSO logged on today's calendar date, across all previous years.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/lookup?call=</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>"Have I worked this call?" &mdash; matching QSOs for a given callsign.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/unconfirmed</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Worked QSOs with no LoTW or eQSL confirmation yet.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/oqrs-matches</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Worked calls that are on Club Log's public OQRS-enabled list.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/export.adi</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Full log as ADIF, round-tripped from each QSO's stored raw record.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/qsos/export.csv</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Full log as CSV.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/import</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Import an ADIF file by hand &mdash; multipart form field <code>adif</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/import/qrz</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Sync from QRZ Logbook, incremental by default. <code>?full=1</code> forces a complete resync.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/import/eqsl</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Sync confirmations from eQSL.cc, incremental by default. <code>?full=1</code> forces a complete recheck.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/import/lotw</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Sync from ARRL LoTW, incremental by default. <code>?full=1</code> forces a complete resync.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/manual</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Log a QSO directly &mdash; JSON body with <code>call</code>/<code>qsoDate</code>/<code>timeOn</code>/<code>band</code>/<code>mode</code> required; country/continent/CQ-zone auto-fill from the callsign. Optional <code>sendToQrz</code> also pushes it to QRZ's logbook.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/qsos/:id/eqsl-card</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Fetches (and caches) that QSO's eQSL card image on demand, one at a time.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Awards &amp; Stats</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/awards</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>DXCC/WAS/WAC/VUCC/WAZ/WPX/Triple-Play/USA-CA/IOTA standings, Most-Wanted list. Optional <code>?band=</code> scopes to a single-band award.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/awards/dxcc-map</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Worked DXCC entities plotted by their own QSOs' average coordinates.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/summary</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Total QSOs, distinct calls, years active, busiest day, longest DX.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/distance</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Great-circle distance histogram + top-10 farthest DX leaderboard.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/activity</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Daily QSO counts, last ~371 days &mdash; powers the GitHub-style activity heatmap.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/by-year</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>QSOs per year.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/activity-pattern</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>QSO counts by UTC hour-of-day &times; day-of-week.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/band-hour-pattern</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>QSO counts by band &times; UTC hour, each band scaled to its own peak.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/stats/qsl-confirmation</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>LoTW/eQSL confirmation totals, overall and by year.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/pota/profile</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>POTA activator/hunter stats, proxied from api.pota.app for this callsign.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Conditions &amp; Propagation</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/today</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Today's SFI, A-index, K-index, sunspot number.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/home</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Station coordinates, inferred from the most common lat/lon across all logged QSOs.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/spots</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Live DX cluster spot feed (dxheat.com), with a Needed flag per spot.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/pskreporter</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Real-time "who's hearing this station" reception reports.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/wspr</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>WSPR beacon reception reports (wspr.live).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/rbn</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>CW/RTTY skimmer reception reports (Reverse Beacon Network).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/contests</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Upcoming contest calendar (WA7BNM).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/conditions/dxpeditions</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Announced/active DXpeditions, cross-referenced against the log.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/solar/history</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Yearly-averaged SFI/K-index, 1932&ndash;present.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/solar/recent</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Daily SFI/K/A-index/sunspot number, last 90 days.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/solar/forecast</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>NOAA's 27-day SFI/A/Kp forecast.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/solar/sync</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Refresh solar data. <code>?full=1</code> rebuilds the entire 1932&ndash;present history.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Radio, Satellites &amp; KiwiSDR</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/radio/status</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Live FlexRadio status &mdash; frequency, mode, SWR, power, temps, on-air state.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/radio/sessions</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Recent on-air session history.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/radio/monitoring</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Toggle the live FlexRadio status connection on/off.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/radio/control</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Remote receive-only tuning (frequency/mode) on a dedicated, non-transmit-capable slice.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/satellites</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Tracked satellite list with live position and next AOS/LOS.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>PATCH /api/satellites/:noradId</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Enable/disable a tracked satellite.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/kiwisdr/status</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Whether the KiwiSDR is configured/enabled and currently reachable.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/kiwisdr/noise-floor</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>One-shot spot-check of the current tuned frequency's noise level.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/kiwisdr/tune</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Retune the shared KiwiSDR listener &mdash; open to any visitor, not admin-gated (one shared receiver).</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Digital Voice</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/brandmeister/lastheard</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Recent DMR activity on the admin-configured talkgroup(s).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/dstar/lastheard</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Recent D-STAR activity on the configured reflector.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Station &amp; Site</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/station-location</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Configured callsign and QTH.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/settings</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Site-wide display settings (currently: distance unit, miles or km).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/sync-status</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Last-synced time (and record count, where tracked) for every external data source &mdash; powers the Status page's Data Sync table.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/system/stats</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Host machine health &mdash; memory, disk, CPU load/temp, uptime.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/geocode?q=</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Address/city/ZIP &rarr; lat/lon, for the Grid Square Converter tool.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/bearing</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Great-circle distance/bearing between two points.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/hamqth/lookup?call=</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Public callsign lookup (name, QTH, grid, IOTA) via HamQTH.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/exam/question-of-the-day</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Today's amateur radio license exam practice question.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/tile-layout/:page</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Saved tile order/visibility for a configurable page (<code>home</code>/<code>tools</code>/<code>electronics</code>/<code>nav</code>).</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-group-heading">Photos &amp; Guestbook</h2>
  <div class="card table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Method &amp; Path</th><th>Auth</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/photos</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Photo gallery listing.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/photos</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Upload a photo &mdash; multipart form fields <code>photo</code> (file, JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP) and optional <code>caption</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>DELETE /api/photos/:id</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Delete a photo.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/guestbook</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Approved guestbook entries.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/guestbook</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Sign the guestbook &mdash; JSON body <code>&lbrace;name, callsign, message&rbrace;</code>; entries are held for admin review before appearing.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /api/guestbook/pending</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Entries awaiting review.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /api/guestbook/:id/approve</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Approve a pending entry.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>DELETE /api/guestbook/:id</code></td><td><span class="auth-badge">Admin</span></td><td>Reject/delete an entry.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;">Not exhaustive &mdash; admin-only config endpoints are omitted. See <a href="/about-this-site">About This Site</a> for the full feature list.</p>
</Base>
